-- Higher-resolution maps: art layer sized for the minimap's own
-- source density instead of Blizzard's fixed layer -- every Type=Zone
-- map, uncapped, plus Kalimdor/Eastern Kingdoms/Azeroth, capped (see
-- hfwm/gamedata/db2.py's _hires_geometry and HIRES_CONTINENT_MAPS). Keyed by
-- UiMapID, not FileDataID -- these draw a bigger grid than the client's
-- own art layer describes, so Renderer.lua uses this geometry and path
-- prefix directly instead of C_Map.GetMapArtLayers / GetMapArtLayerTextures.
-- 1 zones, 1 textures
